# re-record with: go build . && vhs assets/demo.tape
Output assets/demo.gif

Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1040
Set Height 340
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Hide
Type "export PATH=$PWD:$PATH && clear"
Enter
Show
Type "moodle-cli"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 5s

Down@400ms 3
Up@400ms 2
Sleep 1s

Tab
Sleep 1.5s
Down@400ms 3
Sleep 1s

Type "t"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
